SEL: added a Wireshark Lua dissector for SEL ASCII and Compressed ASCII (``distribution/wireshark/selascii.lua``). It decodes commands, response lines, access level prompts, masked passwords, Compressed ASCII checksums, ID output and embedded SEL Fast frames over Telnet, raw TCP, RTAC Communication Monitor captures, exported PDUs and USB, and comes with ``socat2pcap.py`` to turn ``socat`` serial transcripts into captures.
